## Problem
The present member repository limits declarations before service policy can inspect them.
The summary therefore cannot be built from its result, and category-name matching would
repeat source classification in SQL, Rust, and Svelte. Two separate pages need complete
stored-history accounting, exact values, and a common identity while preserving empty
records, duplicate occurrences, funder links, and search context.

