Test duplicate occurrences, empty declarations, unknown categories/currencies, missing amounts,
negative amounts, zero cancellation, large fractional decimals, and whitespace normalization.
Test date filtering before pagination and page reset, UTC boundaries, null dates, and reversed
bounds. Capture desktop/mobile summary and history screenshots from the running branch.
